Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial Black\fs14\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\shad1\pos(192,200)}『Promo Rehearsal』
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready... Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Theater Troupe \NI'm Rose...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut! Sharro-san, it's Ice Rose!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.09,0:00:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not "I'm Rose"!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes it sound like "I am a rose."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that!\NI just stumbled on my words a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Young Lady went out of her way \Nto arrange this promo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,, so you need to take this seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.65,0:00:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just not used to speaking\Nin front of a camera like Nia is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.94,0:00:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready... Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gekidon...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos(192.533,51.911)}"Gekidan" means theater troupe, but Sharro mispronounced it as "Gekidon". In Japanese, ''Geki'' means super/extreme and "-don" refers to a rice bowl dish (like Gyudon or Katsudon).
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut! What do you mean "Gekidon"?\NWhat kind of rice bowl is that supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You started rolling without warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so smart, try it yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Lynokis tries...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.71,0:00:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she actually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, here goes. \NReady... Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Theater Troupe Ice Rose: \N"The Woman Who Fell in Love".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.05,0:00:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting at the theater!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:00:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That was wonderful, Young Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut! Why are you speaking in the middle?!\NAnd hey, why did you do my part perfectly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia, switch with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn! 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.11,0:01:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready... Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.65,0:01:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Theater Troupe Ice Rose: \N"The Woman Who Fell in Love".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting at the theater!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.20,0:01:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.91,0:01:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Wasn't that perfect?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It pales in comparison to the Young Lady,\Nbut... it was decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's the point if the two of you\Nare the ones pulling it off...?
